abstract: >
  The canonical framework library for AI Stewardship in legal and organizational governance — the discipline of deploying artificial intelligence as a human-controlled tool with written accountability, conscience-driven oversight, and moral infrastructure protecting the most vulnerable. Contains 20 operational frameworks across Legal & Organizational Governance and Women-Led Firms tracks.
